### ID Generation Strategy Changes

Hibernate 6 changes the default ID generation behavior:

```java
import jakarta.persistence.*;

@Entity
public class User {

    // IDENTITY strategy - works the same
    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    // AUTO strategy - behavior may differ
    // In Hibernate 6, AUTO is more database-specific
    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.AUTO)
    private Long id;

    // SEQUENCE strategy - recommended for portability
    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.SEQUENCE, generator = "user_seq")
    @SequenceGenerator(name = "user_seq", sequenceName = "user_sequence", allocationSize = 1)
    private Long id;
}
```

